{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ship Is Malfunctioning! Find A Cactus, Quick! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We Need It to Re-start the Quantum Widgets!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just Go!  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471800/extras/5407ace9ce74e8c20f962783a4c0056a.poster.avif?t=1760126742\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471800/extras/5407ace9ce74e8c20f962783a4c0056a.webm?t=1760126742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471800/extras/5407ace9ce74e8c20f962783a4c0056a.mp4?t=1760126742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic quest through a sprawling spaceship in search of vital parts.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a meticulously designed spaceship with its 128 unique rooms, each filled with surprises, challenges, and mind-bending puzzles. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a multitude of whacky enemies that will test your wit and reflexes along the way.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly piranhas! Teddy bears with propeller blades! Crazed medi-bots! Giant robot-eating plants! Gnomes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471800/extras/081d4fb8e45b3921a2997852ee290f77.poster.avif?t=1760126742\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471800/extras/081d4fb8e45b3921a2997852ee290f77.webm?t=1760126742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471800/extras/081d4fb8e45b3921a2997852ee290f77.mp4?t=1760126742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Mainframe Knows All</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You should listen to that thing, it's really smart. Just get the stuff it's asking for, right?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2471800?t=1760126742","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471800/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760126742","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471800/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760126742","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471800/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760126742","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ship Is Malfunctioning! Find A Cactus, Quick! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We Need It to Re-start the Quantum Widgets!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just Go!  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471800/extras/5407ace9ce74e8c20f962783a4c0056a.poster.avif?t=1760126742\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471800/extras/5407ace9ce74e8c20f962783a4c0056a.webm?t=1760126742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471800/extras/5407ace9ce74e8c20f962783a4c0056a.mp4?t=1760126742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h